OL,3,GNEWSADate set for fireworks show at
OL,4,Arevamped waterfront
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town has set the date for its first
OL,7,Ffireworks display since it redeveloped
OL,8,Fits waterfront.
OL,10,FStockton Borough Council has not held
OL,11,Fits firework display since 2021 due to
OL,12,Fthe redevelopment of the town centre,
OL,13,Fwhich saw the demolition of a former
OL,14,Fshopping centre and creation play areas
OL,15,Fand performances spaces.
OL,17,FA free family event is due to take
OL,18,Fplace on November 1, featuring live
OL,19,Fmusic and a fireworks display, which
OL,20,Fcrowds will be able to view from the
OL,21,Furban park's new amphitheatre.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
